{"id":"n82015-1-9","stage":5,"title":"편두통 · 偏头痛","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82015-1-9-1","ko":"민준아, 어디 아파?","zh":"敏俊啊，你哪里不舒服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"아파?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파","audio":"/audio/f1eadb220a21e78bc17f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c50f3d20e7527af6b41c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82015-1-9-2","ko":"편두통이 와서요. 아이고, 머리도 너무 아프고 토할 것 같아요.","zh":"我偏头痛犯了。哎呀，头特别疼，感觉还要吐呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"편두통이","meaning":"偏头痛","explanation":"편두통：偏头痛；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"편두통","audio":"/audio/3f3d312d0147768e46b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82015","senseId":"1","lemma":"편두통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편두통이","audio":"/audio/8d36a4586fe36fbf2183.mp3"}},{"text":"와서요.","meaning":"感到，袭来","explanation":"오다：感到，袭来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"18","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서요","audio":"/audio/125b8322ad2d63f260a8.mp3"}},{"text":"아이고,","meaning":"哎哟","explanation":"아이고：哎哟","readings":[{"term":"아이고","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71354","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이고","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3"}},{"text":"머리도","meaning":"头","explanation":"머리：头；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리도","audio":"/audio/b7dc5b98b88ccc43407e.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"아프고","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프고","audio":"/audio/25a35549edd4244e32f3.mp3"}},{"text":"토할","meaning":"呕吐","explanation":"토하다：呕吐；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"토하다","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49300","senseId":"1","lemma":"토하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토할","audio":"/audio/5f399747aa0ebc5c54b4.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3f3d312d0147768e","term":"편두통","zh":"偏头痛","audio":"/audio/3f3d312d0147768e46b7.mp3","entryId":"82015","definition":"阵发性的一侧头痛。","pronunciation":["편두통"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"感到，袭来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"出现或产生疾病或困意等。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"0d494eb3dbdffe83","term":"아이고","zh":"哎哟","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3","entryId":"71354","definition":"疼痛、辛苦、惊讶、生气时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아이고"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"在人或动物身体中，包括脸和头发的脖子以上的部分。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"ebede831c778366b","term":"토하다","zh":"呕吐","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3","entryId":"49300","definition":"把服下去的食物吐出来。","pronunciation":["토ː하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]